__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
*.md

# The application database. It holds users, chat sessions and chat messages, and it is
# created and seeded at startup (app/core/seed.py re-seeds admin@hcg.com idempotently),
# so the image must never carry one.
#
# Without these lines `COPY . .` baked the LOCAL app.db into every deployed image: five
# throwaway test accounts (finalcheck@example.com, regress.tester@example.com, …) and 24
# debugging chat sessions were shipped to production, and every deploy overwrote whatever
# real data production had accumulated with a developer's laptop state.
#
# .gitignore already excludes these; .dockerignore is a separate list and did not.
app/data/*.db
app/data/*.db-journal
app/data/*.sqlite
app/data/*.sqlite3
app/data/users.json

# Raw HCG client data and line-level caches — patient-level pharmacy sales. `COPY . .`
# would bake them into the image (master/ alone is 2.3 GB). Root-only patterns do not
# match copies inside .claude/worktrees/<wt>/, so each rule also has a **/ form, and the
# worktrees themselves (each with its own .venv and caches) are excluded outright.
master/
**/master/
.cache/
**/.cache/
.claude/
*.xlsx
**/*.xlsx
*.xlsb
**/*.xlsb
*.docx
**/*.docx
